---
// One 404 for both languages: a request for a missing /en/ page also lands here.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="zh" title="404">
  <div class="not-found">
    <h1 class="page-title">页面不存在</h1>
    <p>这个地址没有对应的页面. 可能是链接写错了, 或者文章已经移动. <a href="/">回到首页</a></p>
    <p lang="en">This page does not exist. The link may be wrong, or the post has moved. <a href="/en/">Go to the home page</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
